    "text": "erienewsnow.com\nwebsite\nWarren\nLocal Filmmakers Highlight Warren in New Movie\nBy Jackie Palmer,\n6 hours agoWarren, PA — The red carpet is rolling out later this month as a locally filmed action thriller returns to where it was made. Valley View Motel, a feature film shot in and around Warren, will be shown during a special screening on Saturday, July 26th at the Struthers Library Theatre.",
